Use payments from "payments.capability.json"

To RecoverCarefully, given a day which is a string, returning a string
    the failures are ask payments to list_failed with the day, retrying up to 3 times
    the outcome is "nothing to do"
    for each payment in the failures
        try to
            the result is ask payments to retry with paymentId set to the id of the payment
            if the succeeded of the result
                the outcome is "retried"
        if that fails
            say "Could not retry {the id of the payment}: {the error}"
            the outcome is "failed"
        finally
            say "Looked at {the id of the payment}"
    return the outcome
